# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - DER-L is named in the paper without expansion in the main text; its loss modification follows Sec. 2.2. Energies are total molecular energies (kcal/mol), forces in kcal/mol/A.
